---
import Footer from "@components/Footer.astro";
import Navbar from "@components/Navbar.astro";
import Base from "@layouts/Base.astro";
import "@styles/global.css";
import "@styles/tokens.css";
---

<Base
  title="Cancellation & Refund Policy — Nimbus"
  description="How to cancel your Nimbus subscription and request a refund."
>
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content" class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">
        <svg
          width="14"
          height="14"
          viewBox="0 0 16 16"
          fill="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            d="M10 3L5 8l5 5"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.6"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
        Back to Nimbus
      </a>

      <article class="legal-article">
        <header class="legal-header">
          <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
          <h1 class="legal-title">Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
          <p class="legal-date">Last updated: 4 April 2026</p>
        </header>

        <div class="legal-body">
          <h2>1. Overview</h2>
          <p>
            Nimbus sells annual software subscription licenses. This policy
            explains how to cancel a subscription, when refunds are issued, and
            how long refunds take to process. Payments are collected by
            <strong>Razorpay</strong> (razorpay.com) on behalf of Nimbus.
          </p>

          <h2>2. What you are purchasing</h2>
          <p>
            When you purchase a Nimbus plan you receive a software license for
            the Nimbus WordPress plugin. This is a <strong
              >digital product delivered immediately</strong
            > upon successful payment — no physical goods are shipped. The license
            is valid for one annual billing period and renews automatically unless
            cancelled.
          </p>

          <h2>3. Cancellation</h2>
          <p>
            You may cancel your subscription at any time before the next renewal
            date. To cancel:
          </p>
          <ol>
            <li>
              Email <a href="mailto:hello@usenimbus.dev">hello@usenimbus.dev</a>
              with the subject line <strong>"Cancel subscription"</strong>.
            </li>
            <li>
              Include the email address you used at checkout and, if available,
              your Razorpay subscription ID (shown in your payment confirmation
              email).
            </li>
            <li>
              We will confirm cancellation by email within 1 business day and
              cancel the subscription in Razorpay so no future charges occur.
            </li>
          </ol>
          <p>
            <strong>Effect of cancellation:</strong> Your license remains active until
            the last day of your current paid billing period. After that date, the
            plugin will revert to the free tier automatically — your media files already
            offloaded to your storage provider are not affected and remain accessible.
          </p>
          <p>
            We send a renewal reminder email at least 7 days before each renewal
            date. If you wish to avoid the next renewal charge, cancel before
            that date.
          </p>

          <h2>4. Refunds</h2>

          <h3>14-day money-back guarantee</h3>
          <p>
            We offer a <strong>full refund within 14 days</strong> of your initial
            purchase, no questions asked, as long as the license has not been used
            to offload substantial production data. To request a refund under this
            guarantee:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Email <a href="mailto:hello@usenimbus.dev">hello@usenimbus.dev</a>
              within 14 days of your payment date.
            </li>
            <li>Use the subject line <strong>"Refund request"</strong>.</li>
            <li>
              Include the email address used at checkout and a brief description
              of the issue (optional, but helpful for us to improve).
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We will initiate the refund within 2 business days. The amount will
            be credited to your original payment method, subject to Razorpay's
            processing timelines (typically 5–10 business days).
          </p>

          <h3>Situations where refunds are not available</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Requests made more than 14 days after the original purchase date.
            </li>
            <li>
              Subscription renewal charges. You are responsible for cancelling
              before the renewal date if you do not wish to be charged.
            </li>
            <li>
              Licenses that have been used to offload production data at
              significant volume during the refund window.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>5. Partial-period refunds</h2>
          <p>
            Because Nimbus plans are prepaid annual subscriptions, we do not
            issue pro-rated refunds for the unused portion of a billing period
            after the 14-day guarantee window has elapsed, except where required
            by applicable law.
          </p>

          <h2>6. Failed or disputed payments</h2>
          <p>
            If a payment fails, Razorpay will retry according to its standard
            schedule. If your subscription lapses due to a failed payment, your
            license will be suspended until payment is resolved. Contact
            <a href="mailto:hello@usenimbus.dev">hello@usenimbus.dev</a> if you need
            assistance.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you believe a charge was made in error, please contact us at
            <a href="mailto:hello@usenimbus.dev">hello@usenimbus.dev</a> before filing
            a chargeback with your bank. We will resolve legitimate billing errors
            promptly.
          </p>

          <h2>7. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For all cancellation and refund requests, or any billing questions:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Email: <a href="mailto:hello@usenimbus.dev">hello@usenimbus.dev</a
              >
            </li>
            <li>We aim to respond within 1 business day.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 0 7rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--nmb-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    transition: color var(--nmb-t);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--nmb-text);
  }

  .legal-article {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nmb-border-light);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.028em;
    color: var(--nmb-text);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .legal-date {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--nmb-text-subtle);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--nmb-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0.625rem;
  }

  .legal-body h3 {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--nmb-text);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-body p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--nmb-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
  }

  .legal-body ul,
  .legal-body ol {
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .legal-body li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--nmb-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .legal-body strong {
    color: var(--nmb-text-2);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--nmb-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-body a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
